# The build context of `platform.Dockerfile` (the repository root), which BuildKit reads in place of the root's
# `.dockerignore`: the root's list without `packages/dashboard`, because the services' image builds the console that
# Control serves. The build fetches the commit into a git checkout, so `.git` stays out too.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.tsc-out
.lopata
.wrangler
.git
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/wrangler.jsonc
**/worker-configuration.d.ts
.dev.vars
.env
*.log
